WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:18.140
Vidio a na-akọwa otu esi akwadebe nwa na nne ma ọ bụ onye nlekọta tupu emee ule reflex red fundal na ụmụ amụrụ ọhụrụ na ụmụaka ndị toro eto.

2
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:29.140
Ekwesịrị ijide nwatakịrị ahụ nke ọma ma ọ dị mma, ma ọ bụ n'apata ụkwụ, n'elu ubu, ma ọ bụ, ọ bụrụ na nwatakịrị, dinara n'azụ ya.

3
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:37.120
Ọ dị mkpa ka ha nwee ahụ iru ala. Ụmụaka na-eto eto nwere ike ghara izu ike, ọ pụkwara ịdị mkpa ka afụsa ya.

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.180
Inyocha obere oge mgbe nri gachara nwere ike inye aka n'ihi na ha ga-adị jụụ na obere ụra.

5
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Ụmụaka ndị toro eto nwere ike idozi site n'iji ihe egwuregwu egwuri egwu obere oge.

6
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:55.320
Jiri olu enyi kwuo okwu ma gbalịa gbadata n'ogo anya ha.

7
00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.500
Kọwaa ihe ị ga-eme wee nweta nkwenye tupu ịmalite.

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:10.440
Nke mbụ, jụọ nne ma ọ bụ onye nlekọta ma ọ bụrụ na ha ahụla ihe ọjọọ n'anya ma ọ bụ n'ọhụụ nwa ha na ogologo oge ha chọpụtara nsogbu ahụ.

9
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.120
Ọzọ, lee anya nwa ahụ na ihu ya. Jụọ onwe gị ajụjụ ụfọdụ.

10
00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:24.300
Nwatakịrị ahụ ọ na-enwe mgbu n'otu anya ma ọ bụ abụọ? Anya oghe oghe ka ọ bụ na ha na-emechi ha nke ọma?

11
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:31.280
Enwere mmiri ma ọ bụ na-agbapụta n'anya? Anya hà hà nhata? Nkuchianya a zara aza?

12
00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:38.580
Ugbu a, tụlee otú nwa ahụ si ahụ ihe. Bugharịa ihu gị nwayọ site n'akụkụ ruo n'akụkụ, na-ekiri anya ha.

13
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:47.970
Mee ọnụ ọchị dị jụụ. Nwatakịrị ahụ ọ na-agbaso mmegharị nke ihu gị ma ọ bụ zaghachi ihu ọchị gị na-agbachi nkịtị?

14
00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:53.990
Ọzọ, jụọ onwe gị ajụjụ ụfọdụ. Anya abụọ ahụ hà na-agagharị n'efu na ọnụ?

15
00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:01.110
Anya kwụ ọtọ ka ọ bụ otu anya na-atụgharị n'ime ma ọ bụ apụta? Anya ọ na-ama jijiji?

16
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:12.200
Ị nwekwara ike iji ọkụ na Arclight na ihe atụ foto iji nweta nlebara anya na nyochaa àgwà nke ọhụụ.

17
00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:20.660
Bugharịa akụkụ ebumnuche gaa n'akụkụ, elu na ala. Lelee ma ọ bụrụ na nwatakịrị ahụ na-edozi ma na-agbaso ebumnuche.

18
00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:26.600
Ha nwere ike iru wee tụọ aka n'ụzọ ziri ezi na ebumnuche?

19
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:35.060
Ọtụtụ mgbe, nanị otu anya na-apụghị ịhụ nke ọma. Gị ma ọ bụ nne nwere ike kpuchie otu anya, wee kpuchie nke ọzọ.

20
00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:43.320
Bugharịa ihe mgbaru ọsọ ma tụnyere otú nwatakịrị ahụ si akpa àgwà mgbe ị na-eji anya abụọ, mgbe ahụ otu n'otu oge.

21
00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:51.380
Ọ bụrụ na nwa ahụ enweghị mmasị ka e kpuchie otu anya, ọ na-egosi na anya ekpuchighị anya adịghị ahụ nke ọma.

22
00:02:51.560 --> 00:03:00.560
Ọ bụrụ na ị chere na ị nwere ike ịhụ ihe na-adịghị mma na anya mpụga, lelee anya nke ọma site na iji njedebe loupe nke Arclight.

23
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:12.150
Gbanwee ọkụ ma gaa n'ihu na nso 6 cm. Ị nwere ike iji mkpịsị aka gị meghee anya nku anya nke ọma.

24
00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:24.070
Jụọ onwe gị ajụjụ ụfọdụ. Akụkụ ọcha nke anya ọ bụ pink ka ọ bụ ọbara ọbara? Nwa akwụkwọ ma ọ bụ cornea isi awọ ka ọ bụ ọcha?

25
00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:35.160
Nwa akwụkwọ a gbara gburugburu? Ị nwere ike ịhụ ozu mba ọzọ ọ bụla? Ugbu a, ị dịla njikere ime ule reflex.
